  "releaseNotes": "refactor(buffer): add ReadOnlyMemory/ReadOnlySpan accessors for safer immutable views\n\n      - Added AsReadOnlyMemory(start, length) and AsReadOnlySpan(start, length) to provide\n      immutable views over buffer content without additional allocations.\n      - Ensures full symmetry between Memory/Span and ReadOnlyMemory/ReadOnlySpan APIs.\n      - All new accessors are thin wrappers over existing Memory-first core and introduce\n      zero performance overhead.\n      - Verified correctness through unit tests; benchmark performance remains unchanged.",
